<</Dest[ 339 0 R /XYZ 43 293 0]/Next 4043 0 R /Parent 4039 0 R /Prev 4041 0 R /Title(To better understand optical transmission losses, consider these approaches:Modal Analysis: Characterize the modal power distribution within optical fibers using advanced computational tools like Finite-Difference Time-Domain \(FDTD\) simulations. This ...)>>
